      "writtenOn": "2024-08-22T07:58:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought you meant that the flag declaration in the output profile was DIRECT | DEEP. This would be unsupported. \nYou wrote \"Otherwise, APM can try profiles which has combination of (AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_DEEP_BUFFER | AUDIO_OUTPUT_FLAG_DIRECT)\"\nWhat I don\u0027t understadn is why is DEEP_BUFFFER relevant here?\n\nwhen getProfileForOutput() is called with directOnly \u003d\u003d true, getRelevantFlags() will filter out the DEEP_BUFFER flag anyway.\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/services/audiopolicy/managerdefault/AudioPolicyManager.cpp;l\u003d1042?q\u003dgetRelevantFlags",
